      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Page%2C_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The city is the gateway to Glen Canyon National Recreation Area and Lake Powell, drawing over 3 million visitors yearly, and Antelope Canyon opened to tourists in 1997.",
